Package: gsettings-desktop-schemas
Version: @DEB_GSDS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://download.gnome.org/sources/gsettings-desktop-schemas/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libglib2.0-bin
Description: GSettings desktop-wide schemas
 Shared GSettings schemas for the GNOME desktop stack (org.gnome.desktop.*,
 org.gnome.system.*). Data only; read by GLib/GIO at runtime. glib-compile-schemas
 must be run on the schema directory after install.
